<title>USA: Opta Food Q1 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>Opta Food Q1 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>(in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>					     For the three months ended</p>
<p>								 March 31,</p>
<p>							    1997	1996</p>
<p> Revenue						  2,033     2,501</p>
<p> Net loss					     (1,191)   (1,049)</p>
<p> Net loss per share				  (0.11)    (0.10)</p>
<p> Weighted average shares outstanding	   10,977    10,764</p>
<p>NOTE: The company said current first quarter revenue was hurt by less demand from a major customer.</p>
<p>Full company name is Opta Food Ingredients Inc.</p>
</text>
